---
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
eleventyComputed:
  permalink: "{{ '/_headers' if visible.column == 'dev' else false }}"
---
{#- DEV AND PREVIEW ARE NOT TO BE FOUND BY SEARCH (2026-10-13). Both serve
    the whole site to anyone — dev always has, and the preview has since it
    builds from the dev column (src/_data/visible.js) — so without this, the
    unreleased site sits in two places a search engine may index. Cloudflare
    applies a `_headers` file in the built folder to every static file it
    serves. Written only by a build on the dev column — the Pi's dev server
    and the preview — never by the live build, whose pages must be found. -#}
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
